stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB

    [*] --> idle
    idle --> understanding: 提交问题 / 恢复会话

    understanding --> planning: 形成或修订研究目标
    understanding --> awaiting_user: 普通回复 / 请求补充信息

    planning --> validating_plan: 生成 EDAPlan
    planning --> awaiting_user: 规划失败，需用户决定
    validating_plan --> planning: 计划错误可自动修复
    validating_plan --> awaiting_approval: 计划有效
    validating_plan --> awaiting_user: 计划错误不可自动修复

    awaiting_approval --> executing_tools: approve / timeout_accept
    awaiting_approval --> understanding: modify
    awaiting_approval --> stopped: reject / stop

    executing_tools --> validating_result: 单个 ToolCall 完成
    executing_tools --> evaluating: 工具队列耗尽
    validating_result --> executing_tools: 校验通过 / 执行下一项
    validating_result --> planning: 证据问题可修订
    validating_result --> awaiting_user: 证据限制需用户决定

    evaluating --> planning: revise（授权范围内）
    evaluating --> awaiting_user: accept / need_user / reject

    awaiting_user --> understanding: followup / next_round / modify
    awaiting_user --> planning: retry plan
    awaiting_user --> evaluating: retry finalize / accept limitations
    awaiting_user --> completed: 接受结果并结束
    awaiting_user --> stopped: stop

    validating_plan --> failed: 不可恢复的契约错误
    executing_tools --> failed: 不可恢复的执行错误
    evaluating --> failed: 不可恢复的最终化错误

    completed --> [*]
    stopped --> [*]
    failed --> [*]

    note right of awaiting_user
      Graph interrupt 暂停运行；
      ResumePayload 决定下一条迁移。
    end note

    note right of failed
      phase 是会话主状态；
      LoopCursor 另行记录 episode / iteration / call。
    end note
